@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@userAccessToken = replace-with-user-access-token
@sessionId = 1
@reservationId = 1

### 예약 생성
# 새로운 예약 시도에는 아래 키를 새 값으로 변경하세요.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: reservation-key-123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "participantCount": 2
}

### 같은 Idempotency-Key / 같은 요청 재시도
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: reservation-key-123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "participantCount": 2
}

### 같은 Idempotency-Key / 다른 요청 - 실패 예상
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: reservation-key-123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "participantCount": 3
}

### 내 예약 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/me?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}

### 예약 취소
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/{{reservationId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}
